Tiku Prompt (题库提示词)
Copyright (c) 2026 pchartming

Tiku Prompt is an independent, unofficial prompt-generation tool. It assembles
text prompts locally and does not call an AI service, require an API key, or
request network access. It is not an official component of StudyOnTV / 题了个题,
PlanYourTV, or 学习锁; those names are used only to describe compatible import
formats and data provenance.

The bundled course catalog is derived from PlanYourTV's textbook catalog asset,
which is licensed under the MIT License:

  Copyright (c) 2026 PlanYourTV contributors

The catalog contains textbook, unit, and lesson titles only. It does not contain
textbook body text, images, question banks, answers, or third-party app assets.
The titles are compiled from the public curriculum catalog of the National Smart
Education Platform (国家中小学智慧教育平台, https://basic.smartedu.cn/). This
project claims no endorsement by that platform.

No source code, application resources, APKs, or question banks from StudyOnTV or
学习锁 are included. Their names are used only to describe compatible import
formats; compatibility is unofficial and may break when those apps change.

Third-party dependencies and the full PlanYourTV MIT notice are listed in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. The project's own source is licensed under the MIT
License in LICENSE.